    "text": "<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/TYcOVCHhyD7Ep5QjIfRNd4Z-BVnCVVqI_MsguvXZzqQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Required area }=2 \\int_0^{\\sqrt{3}}\\left(2 x^2+9-5 x^2\\right) d x \\\\ & =2\\left[9 x-x^3\\right]_0^{\\sqrt{3}}=2[9 \\sqrt{3}-3 \\sqrt{3}]=12 \\sqrt{3} .\\end{aligned}$",
